{"title": "沙发上的哲学家", "index": 5, "content": [{"type": "html", "value": "<body class=\"calibre\">\n<p class=\"calibre_9\" id=\"filepos10409\"><span class=\"calibre1\">第一章</span></p><blockquote class=\"calibre_17\"><blockquote class=\"calibre_18\">正是因为拥有意识，人们才能自由做出选择。</blockquote></blockquote><div class=\"mbp_pagebreak\" id=\"calibre_pb_4\"></div>\n</body>"}]}